## 32. AI Should Be Optional

Do not make AI the foundation of the dashboard.

The correct architecture is:

```text
DATA
 ↓
DATABASE
 ↓
CALCULATIONS
 ↓
DASHBOARD
 ↓
OPTIONAL AI
```

Not:

```text
DATA
 ↓
AI
 ↓
Random business numbers
```

AI can explain analytics, detect anomalies, or generate forecasts, but the underlying business calculations must remain deterministic and traceable.

---

## 33. Explainability

For every major KPI, the user should be able to understand where the number came from.

Example:

```text
Profit = ₹85,420

Calculation:
Net Sales = ₹250,000
Cost = ₹164,580
Profit = ₹250,000 - ₹164,580
```

This is useful for both real users and your interview demonstration.

---

