Build the project so you can confidently explain:

### Python

How Pandas and NumPy process the data.

### SQL

How data is stored and queried.

### Database

How tables are related.

### Data Analytics

How KPIs are calculated.

### Visualization

Why particular charts were selected.

### Streamlit

How the web application works.

### Git/GitHub

How the project is version controlled.

### Deployment

How the application became a live website.

### AI

Why AI was added and what problem it solves.

Do not add technologies merely to increase the technology list.

